<code>-f &lt;f&gt;</code>: File to process. Either this or <code>-d</code> =
is required.</li>
<li>
<code>-d &lt;d&gt;</code>: Directory to recursively process. Either this or=
 <code>-f</code> is required.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3>Analysis of <em>single</em> LNK File using LECmd</h3>
<p>Let's run the LECmd tool against a single <code>.lnk</code> file to unde=
rstand what kind of information we can gather. Here's an example of process=
