ull path in double quotes. And there should <b><code>only</code></b> be sho=
rtcut files in the directory, otherwise it may not work. </p>
    </div>
</div>
<p>Then we'll run the command below with the following option:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<code>-d</code>: This option requires the path of the directory for process=
ing recursively.</li>
</ul>
